  "transcript": {
    "callId": "7782934452004",
    "transcript": [
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3774,
            "text": "Hey there, thanks for making time for this."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 7549,
            "end": 41518,
            "text": "Hi, glad this time worked for both of us."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 49067,
            "end": 64165,
            "text": "We wanted to make sure we covered a couple of open items today."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 71714,
            "end": 86811,
            "text": "Glad to make time for this, let's walk through the list."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 90586,
            "end": 105683,
            "text": "The attendee kiosk has to keep taking people in even if the venue connection goes down, and catch back up automatically the moment it reconnects."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 117007,
            "end": 143427,
            "text": "Our fall symposium runs close to 600 members through the door, and the kiosk froze for nearly half an hour when the hotel's connection went out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 147202,
            "end": 166074,
            "text": "Thanks, that gives me a clearer picture, one follow up though."
          },
          {
            "start": 166075,
            "end": 181171,
            "text": "Do you know roughly how long the outage lasted and whether anyone had to be checked in manually on paper in the meantime?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 184946,
            "end": 188720,
            "text": "Close to half an hour, and we lost track of at least a dozen people who we had to look up again afterward."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 196269,
            "end": 226464,
            "text": "Good, switching gears, anything else come up recently?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 234013,
            "end": 271757,
            "text": "We are still backfilling a role that opened up over the summer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 279306,
            "end": 317050,
            "text": "Glad to hear reinforcements are coming for the team."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 328373,
            "end": 335922,
            "text": "Our team could use a refresher on some of the newer features."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 343471,
            "end": 369892,
            "text": "Happy to help put together some training resources if that would be useful."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 381215,
            "end": 392538,
            "text": "Registration for our next event opened last week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 400087,
            "end": 411410,
            "text": "Hope the annual meeting goes well, sounds like a big one."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 418959,
            "end": 456703,
            "text": "We just brought on a new coordinator last month."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 468026,
            "end": 479349,
            "text": "Hope being short staffed does not last too much longer."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 490672,
            "end": 513319,
            "text": "We would like more structured training for our newer staff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 517093,
            "end": 547289,
            "text": "We can send over some materials that might help."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 554837,
            "end": 569935,
            "text": "Attendance has been trending up for our last few events."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 577484,
            "end": 585033,
            "text": "Sounds like the calendar planning never really stops for you all."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 588807,
            "end": 622777,
            "text": "We added two people to the team this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 626551,
            "end": 652972,
            "text": "Appreciate you letting us know, we can adjust support as needed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 664295,
            "end": 698265,
            "text": "A few of our staff are still getting up to speed on the system."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 702039,
            "end": 732234,
            "text": "Good on you for prioritizing training even when things are busy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 736009,
            "end": 754881,
            "text": "We added a couple of new session tracks this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 758655,
            "end": 792625,
            "text": "Nice, a strong keynote usually helps with turnout."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 796399,
            "end": 807722,
            "text": "It has been a season of change with a few new faces around."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 811497,
            "end": 849241,
            "text": "That is a big shift, let us know if training support would help."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 856790,
            "end": 868113,
            "text": "We try to run a refresher training every few months."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 875662,
            "end": 913406,
            "text": "That is great, glad the new staff are getting up to speed."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 917180,
            "end": 951150,
            "text": "We are trying a new registration platform for the upcoming conference."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 962473,
            "end": 1000217,
            "text": "Sounds like a lot of moving pieces, glad the team has it handled."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1011540,
            "end": 1049284,
            "text": "A couple of part time staff moved into full time roles."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1056833,
            "end": 1071931,
            "text": "Sounds like a busy stretch for the team, hope it eases up soon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1075705,
            "end": 1102126,
            "text": "We are training a backup person in case someone is out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1109675,
            "end": 1128547,
            "text": "Let us know if a live walkthrough for the board would be helpful."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1132321,
            "end": 1143644,
            "text": "We are deep into planning for our fall conference right now."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1151193,
            "end": 1158742,
            "text": "Nice to have sponsors lined up early."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1170065,
            "end": 1196486,
            "text": "We promoted someone from within to lead a team."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1204035,
            "end": 1230456,
            "text": "Congrats on the internal move, that is great to hear."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1238004,
            "end": 1275748,
            "text": "We are putting together some internal documentation to help with training."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1283297,
            "end": 1298395,
            "text": "Good idea, refresher sessions usually help retention."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1302169,
            "end": 1336139,
            "text": "The events team is finalizing the printed materials this week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1339913,
            "end": 1343688,
            "text": "Good luck locking down the venue, hope it comes together soon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1355011,
            "end": 1370108,
            "text": "We are training a new hire on our systems this week."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1381432,
            "end": 1396529,
            "text": "Nice that you were able to promote from within."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1400304,
            "end": 1438048,
            "text": "We just finished onboarding a new batch of volunteers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1449371,
            "end": 1479566,
            "text": "Glad to hear you are investing in training, that usually pays off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1490889,
            "end": 1494664,
            "text": "We are expecting a bigger crowd than usual this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1505987,
            "end": 1528633,
            "text": "That is a good sign if attendance keeps trending up."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1532408,
            "end": 1558829,
            "text": "We restructured a bit after a few departures this year."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1562603,
            "end": 1600347,
            "text": "Good to hear you found someone for the new hire."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1611670,
            "end": 1645640,
            "text": "We are still working out the best way to train remote staff."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "2002",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1656963,
            "end": 1672061,
            "text": "Appreciate you covering all of this, I will follow up soon."
          },
          {
            "start": 1672062,
            "end": 1683384,
            "text": "Thanks for today, I will make sure this gets tracked properly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "speakerId": "c-04",
        "topic": null,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "start": 1687158,
            "end": 1706030,
            "text": "Glad we got through everything on our list, thanks for the time."
          },
          {
            "start": 1706031,
            "end": 1728677,
            "text": "Thanks again, looking forward to hearing what comes next."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
